WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:46.200
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:52.200
Starlight cuts across the glass

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:59.500
Watching the quiet nebulae pass

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:07.800
Telemetry hums, fading in and out

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:15.500
